WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:16.800
Who checks the proof?

00:16.800 --> 00:33.571
Proofs become data.

00:33.571 --> 00:49.408
Infer. Simplify. Compare.

00:49.408 --> 01:06.709
Write a theorem, not a tree.

01:06.709 --> 01:22.947
A result you can reproduce.

01:22.947 --> 01:49.803
Proof rules live outside the compiler.
